  "pixel_findings": [
    "Closed annular carrier is continuous in roundel_tracing and rake_pier_contact. Former triangular segment seams are no longer visible; remaining small faceted shading is surface shading, not open holes.",
    "All roundels visible in the dedicated tracing/contact views are complete circles clear of the sloped fascia. Intentional redistribution places circles at crown and lower flanks with two wider intervals at the roof pinch; this remains coherent at full-building scale and preserves the decorated-gable identity.",
    "Four decorated gables, cruciform roof topology, central glazed lantern, corner pyramidal rooflights, metal arcades and coloured awnings are preserved across front, rear, both sides, aerial and top.",
    "Lower glazing provides actual visible room depth, market stalls and columns. Interior shows an unobstructed central aisle, overhead framing and rooflight; opening treatment does not collapse to opaque window stickers.",
    "Rake end seats on the stone pier capital; shield and crest remain clear and supported. Ground contact shadows are visible at plinths without a demonstrated continuous air gap.",
    "No new visible P0/P1 defect found across all twenty baseline/detail renders and four boards. Source comparison supports an architectural-clay abstraction, not a photoreal replica."
  ],
